        "## Summary of Key Findings and Insights\n",
        "\n",
        "### KDE Plot of Age by Heart Attack Outcome\n",
        "- The KDE plot revealed distinct age distributions for individuals with and without heart attacks. Individuals who experienced heart attacks tend to have a higher median age (65.00) compared to those who did not, indicating age as a significant risk factor.\n",
