        "### Correlation Matrix of Heart Attack Risk Factors\n",
        "- The heatmap of the correlation matrix showed various relationships between risk factors and the heart attack outcome. Notable positive correlations were observed between 'Heart_Attack_Outcome' and 'Age', 'Cholesterol_Level', 'Blood_Pressure_Systolic', 'Obesity_Index', and 'LDL_Level'. This suggests that higher values in these factors are associated with an increased likelihood of heart attack.\n",
